*

# Share GitNexus navigation artifacts (wiki, metadata, runner) so viewers get a
# working code-intelligence map without re-running (paid) AI analysis. The large
# local database (lbug, ~233MB) and the parser caches (parse-cache,
# parsedfile-cache) stay out of git -- the database is distributed via GitHub
# Releases instead; run ./fetch-db.sh from this directory to download it.
# Re-create everything locally with `node .gitnexus/run.cjs analyze`.
!.gitignore
!run.cjs
!meta.json
!wiki/
!wiki/**
!fetch-db.sh
!DOWNLOAD-DB.md
